  "description": "<p>Whether you are on the hunt or heading to the archery range, the Fred Bear Camo Flannel Shirt offers unbeatable warmth and comfort. These hunting shirts are great for either wearing on their own or layering as a shirt jacket. These camo flannels are perfect for hunters, fishermen, and other outdoor enthusiasts. Two Iconic Brands Unite: In collaboration with Bear Archery, the revered Fred Bear camouflage pattern comes to life through Rothco&rsquo;s legendary outdoor apparel and gear, including our Extra Heavyweight Flannel Shirts. Each item in the Fred Bear Camouflage collection has been crafted using the iconic Fred Bear camo pattern. Rugged Material Construction: The flannel shirt jacket is crafted from heavyweight (8 oz) cotton fabric that is breathable, comfortable, and warm. From bowhunting to fishing, the camo hunting shirt overcomes any strenuous outdoor activity while providing long-lasting comfort and warmth. Classic Design: The camouflage bowhunting shacket features a 6-button closure, 2 button-down front flap pockets, and single-button wrist cuffs for timeless style and comfortable wear. Both chest pockets are ideal for storing small EDC essentials and hunting accessories. Care Instructions: For best fit and finish, machine wash cold, non-chlorine bleach when needed, do not tumble dry, and warm iron if needed.</p>",
